WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.402
-Welcome back.
We're here with Kate McKinnon.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.969
And Kate,
I don't need to tell you this.

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:05.538
You were in "Barbie" this year.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:06.606
[ Applause ]

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:08.240
-Yeah, I was. Yeah.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.710
-But I didn't know this,

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:16.782
that you and Greta Gerwig,
roommates in college.

00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:17.884
Look at that.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.852
-We were in the same suite.

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:21.420
-Okay, I'm gonna count it.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:25.658
-We were in the same suite
with also two girls who...

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.793
God, they barfed in that tub.
-Yeah.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:30.497
-There was just...
There was puke in that tub.

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:33.365
-Two tub barfers?
-Yeah. We didn't know that.

00:00:33.365 --> 00:00:35.401
They were like,
two that got tacked on,

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:37.237
and my gosh.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.804
-More than once,
they barfed in the tub?

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:40.573
-Yeah, a couple times.
-Wow.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.008
-More than a couple times.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:45.545
And I thought, "Oh, I can't
wait to get out of here."

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.014
-Yeah. So, Greta,
your old friend you've known

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:51.183
since your late teens,
calls you up to say

00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:52.452
that she wants you to play
Weird Barbie.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:53.620
-Right.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.853
-That must have been
a very exciting call.

00:00:54.853 --> 00:00:57.556
-It was very exciting,
and it was also like --

00:00:57.556 --> 00:00:59.858
Well, she was like,
"I'm doing the Barbie movie."

00:00:59.858 --> 00:01:00.994
And I was like, "Oh."

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:05.464
"Cool. Okay."

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:07.700
And she's like,
"I have a character for you."

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.004
And I was like, "Oh...okay."

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:13.372
And she was like, "It's --"

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:14.707
I was like, "What is it?"

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.108
And she was like,
"It's Weird Barbie."

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:19.745
And I was like, "Okay,
so it's a documentary.

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:23.483
My portion will be
a biopic of me."

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.818
And so I was like,
"Okay, yeah, fine."

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:29.221
-What was the inspiration
for, uh -- visually,

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:32.125
what did you want Weird Barbie?

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:37.864
-Well, so, Greta told me
that it was like the Barbie doll

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:41.801
that everyone had
that was messed up

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.570
where like,
you'd cut the hair off

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.805
and you'd burn it and, like,
mess the clothes up and stuff.

00:01:46.805 --> 00:01:48.341
And I had a lot of experience
with that,

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.943
because my little sister
and her friends

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:54.446
had a lot of Barbie stuff
going on,

00:01:54.446 --> 00:01:57.283
and there was one that they,
like, cut the hair off,

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.651
and she was always naked
and her leg

00:01:59.651 --> 00:02:01.120
was always like, off.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:03.255
And they called her Urinelle,

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:08.494
because someone at one point
had, I don't know.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:12.532
-Based on the name, I do know.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:17.436
-So I just thought,
well, if if there was

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:22.375
ever in my life a character
for me, that would be it.

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:24.577
-And you got --
We brought the doll.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.312
-Oh, yeah.
-How did you feel when you knew

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.448
there was going to be
a Weird Barbie?

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:30.316
-Oh, fine. I mean --
-Yeah.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.051
-Pretty normal. This is just --

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:33.987
-I mean, it wasn't
as exciting as Jug Day.

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:36.489
-No, nothing could be
as exciting as --

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.824
I'll take off the hair net.
Yeah, I guess she's also --

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:39.992
-I mean, you have to be --

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:41.760
I'd be pretty happy with
how this turned out.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.362
-No, it's amazing.
It's incredible.

00:02:43.362 --> 00:02:45.798
And you know,
the costumes were so fun

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:47.132
and the sets
were so fun and stuff,

00:02:47.132 --> 00:02:51.671
and this is the hair
that I am going for.

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:55.408
It's on its way.

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:59.913
This is where I've always --
This is me in the woods.

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.514
That's what I am.
-Yeah.

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.150
-And what I've always been.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.385
-Oh, my God. One-handed!

00:03:06.385 --> 00:03:08.454
No. Kate, no!

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:11.324
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:12.858
I am --

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:13.960
I'll tell you this.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:14.994
I'll tell you this
before I let you go.

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:16.295
-What?

00:03:16.295 --> 00:03:17.596
-I'm so jealous of everybody
who works at that show

00:03:17.596 --> 00:03:20.233
that they get to get one
more week with Kate McKinnon,

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:21.634
because nobody did it better.
-Aww.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.302
-And I'm so excited
to watch on Saturday.

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:24.536
-Thank you, Seth.

00:03:24.536 --> 00:03:26.305
-What a delight
to have you here.

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:27.473
I missed you so very much.

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:28.975
I miss you too.
-You guys,

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.243
that's Kate McKinnon, everybody.

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:32.578
She's hosting "SNL" this weekend

00:03:32.578 --> 00:03:34.013
with musical guest
Billie Eilish,

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.648
which airs live
on NBC and Peacock.

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:36.615
We'll be right back with

00:03:36.615 --> 00:03:38.418
Carmelo Anthony
and The Kid Mero.

